Subject: [PATCH] kernel: fix Realtek r8169 phylink dependency for 7.4

The Linux 7.4 r8169 driver uses the phylink module. Select the
conditional dependency so kmod-r8169 declares phylink.ko.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/netdevices.mk
@@ -1383,1 +1383,1 @@ define KernelPackage/r8169
-  DEPENDS:=@PCI_SUPPORT +kmod-mii +r8169-firmware +kmod-phy-realtek +kmod-mdio-devres
+  DEPENDS:=@PCI_SUPPORT +kmod-mii +r8169-firmware +kmod-phy-realtek +kmod-mdio-devres +LINUX_7_4:kmod-phylink
